# A pointer local whose name is 300 bytes, written and read through: the word `\name` was taken in at most
# 255 bytes, and a longer one was refused as "assignment target must be a declared typed mutable value"
# (owner group 3 of the expression text, section 99).  Success is 7.
fn: check () int
    size_t: v 3U
    @: size_t  @v
    \: 9U
    if: \ != 9U
        return: 1
return: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: check(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
